{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id132416663"}, "name":{"label":"strawberryblood"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-05-28T08:46:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2.4"}, "id":{"label":"9974537292"}, "title":{"label":"Doesn’t Know Who Is Who"}, "content":{"label":"From the free demo version this app was giving out some absolute goldmine lines so I figured why not just buy a year subscription (Much cheaper than the insane weekly model.)\n\nIt seemed like a somewhat useful tool for being absolutely brain stumped when it comes to texting people but I have since found out 90% of the time it has absolutely no idea who it should be talking for. It will just say lines as if it is anyone in the conversation and there’s not a way to clarify who is who. This makes a lot of the things it says just not make any sense whatsoever.\n\nOnce in a blue moon it will say something so amazing I never could have thought of it without the resource but most of the time it is just a confused funny mess.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1663430725&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
